##v1.08.00
* Add OpenBeken support, discovered by scan and backed up via its own api
* Backup and restore Tasmota32 berry scripts alongside the config
* Add checkboxes with select-all for bulk delete, download and send-command
* Per-row Actions dropdown replaces the always-visible buttons
* Bulk download produces one zip holding the latest backup of each device
* Add backup locking, a locked backup is never deleted until unlocked
* Bulk lock the latest backup, or lock individual versions on the listing
* Scheduled pruning skips locked backups and no longer counts them
* Same checkbox and bulk toolbar on the per-device backup listing
* Add Debug Logging setting, logs http, mqtt, scan, backup and restore
* Fix downloads always named .dmp, now follows the stored file type
* Fix listbackups warning four times and showing no device on a plain url

##v1.07.00
* Fix duplicate devices created when a device's ip changed, now matched by mac then hostname before ip
* Add Hostname column, toggle it like the Mac column
* Fix failed backups being reported as successful, and pruning good backups afterward
* Fix scheduled backups doing nothing until Backup-All Min Hours had been saved once
* Fix dark mode settings/lock icons not showing, broken media query
* Restore now reports success or failure instead of no feedback
* Fix invalid sql updating a device with no password set
* Fix delete backup reporting success for a backup that didn't exist
* Fix device rename updating every device sharing an ip instead of just one
* Fix mqtt discovery leaking one device's ip/mac onto the next
* Fix scan re-probing and double listing the last address of a range
* Normalize mac addresses stored in mixed case/format on upgrade
* Fix restore silently failing on Tasmota v15.5+, referer check now enforced by default
* Verified compatible with Tasmota v13/v14/v15 http and mqtt api
* Add multi-language interface, Settings > Language, auto-detects from browser
* Seed 28 language catalogues, unreviewed machine translations pending native review
* Add docker buildx build option, cross builds without qemu binaries
* Add automated test suite, make test

